{
  "name": "Wedding - Guest Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Guest list from Google Sheets\n\nType guests in the sheet tab **Guests**: only **name**, **pax** (number of people, also the most the guest can confirm) and **table**. Leave **token**, **link** and **status** empty; this workflow fills them.\n\n**Top row, Sync guest sheet:** new rows get a secret token and are created in the **wedding_guests** Data Table; rows that already have a token update name / pax / table. The sheet then shows each guest's personal link and RSVP / check-in status. Safe to run again. Nothing is ever deleted.\n\nBefore running: attach your Google credential to **Read guest sheet** and **Write back to sheet**, pick the spreadsheet in both, and set the site address in **Settings**.\n\n**Bottom row, Reset test guests:** clears RSVP and check-in of the fixed test guests (token starts with 7e57) so you can try RSVP and scanning again. Real guests are never touched.\n\n**Third row, Export wishes:** copies every Kind Words message from the **wedding_wishes** Data Table into the sheet tab **Kind Words** (columns id, time in UTC, name, message). Run it whenever you like, for example once after the event: already exported wishes are not duplicated.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 380
      },
      "id": "ac9d7130-f41d-485a-9d82-63a752f20cc5",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
